faction alife_cordon
  about.title 101st Airborne - Knox Cordon Detachment
  about.heading Military Quarantine Force
  about.blurb The Army's line round the Exclusion Zone, drawn by the 101st Airborne Division (Air Assault) out of Fort Campbell, still standing where the order left it. Masks on, plates in, ammunition that does not run out: they hold the bridge, and nothing crosses it twice.
